//     all his new ones, are lightly Southern: he drops his g's and says ain't, and the kinder he is the slower he talks.
//   - The coin is RANGER's. Grandpa Joe tells where it is (nevada.old.saw.5 to .8) and nobody hands it over: Big Sister
